                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "2X7ls",
                      "name": "wbNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 三栏联动：点左侧案件行 → 中栏画像/快照/图谱与右栏判定摘要同步刷新，不得异步错位。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oAf3l",
                      "name": "wbNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 「处理结论」与「联动处置动作」均为必填，未选时提交按钮置灰并提示（E09.conclusion / action_type）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "If3J0",
                      "name": "wbNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 处置动作会联动写入 list_entries（拉黑/封禁）并调用 BizAdapter；当前无真实业务系统，默认 MockBizAdapter 只记日志（G-08）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ew0yn",
                      "name": "wbNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 特征快照必须展示「本次值 vs 基线值 vs 偏离」，仅罗列本次值无法支撑人工研判。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "7Q0yd",
                      "name": "wbNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 处置提交前需二次确认弹窗；提交后写 case_actions + audit_logs（哈希链），案件状态流转为 disposed。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YrjNH",
                      "name": "wbNote5",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "6. 关联图谱默认 2 跳，「同设备/同IP/同地址聚集账号」需在图例中明确区分。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
